.TH stool-dotfile-gpg-restore 1  "stool-dotfile-gpg-restore "
.SH NAME
stool\-dotfile\-gpg\-restore \- Validate and restore an encrypted GPG key backup
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstool\-dotfile\-gpg\-restore\fR [\fB\-\-input\fR] [\fB\-\-identity\fR] [\fB\-\-passphrase\-file\fR] [\fB\-\-gpg\-program\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validate and restore an encrypted GPG key backup
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-input\fR \fI<INPUT>\fR
Backup directory (defaults to .stooltemplates/gpg in the source)
.TP
\fB\-\-identity\fR \fI<IDENTITY>\fR
Separate age identity for identity\-encrypted backups
.TP
\fB\-\-passphrase\-file\fR \fI<PASSPHRASE_FILE>\fR
Read the password from a private file outside the repository
.TP
\fB\-\-gpg\-program\fR \fI<GPG_PROGRAM>\fR
GPG executable (defaults to gpg on PATH)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
